<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Nggunakake Variabel lan Simbol Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170654957487">Simbol panglumpukan ing aljabar mèmper karo koma, titik loro, lan tandha wacan liyane ing basa Indonesia. Simbol kasebut njlentrehake ekspresi endi sing kudu diklumpukake lan dipisahake saka ekspresi liyane. Saiki bakal ditepungake telung jinis.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655219760">
<title>Simbol Panglumpukan</title>
<equation id="fs-id1167269979347" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Tandha kurung biasa</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.15em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow /><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Tandha kurung siku</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.15em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow /><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Tandha kurung kurawal</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mrow><m:mo>{</m:mo><m:mrow /><m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654880176">Ing ngisor iki ana sawetara tuladha ekspresi sing ngemot <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00011">simbol panglumpukan</term>. Mengko ing subbab iki, ekspresi kaya iki bakal digawe luwih prasaja.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654936322" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mo>{</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1166424830424"><newline /></para>
</section>
